#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:4
msgid "v4.4.5"
msgstr "v4.4.5"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.4.5 adds firmware loading and recovery for the new Alif Ensemble (OpenMV "
"Cam AE3) boards, ships complete localized UI translations across the full "
"bundled language set, and grows the bundled model zoo with a large DeGirum "
"collection and a new Qualcomm AI Hub vendor section. The release stays on "
"the Qt Creator 14.0.2 base. A few menu items and developer command-line "
"options were removed; see :ref:`Breaking changes <changelog_ide_v4_4_5>`."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.5 ajoute le chargement et la récupération du micrologiciel pour les "
"nouvelles cartes Alif Ensemble (OpenMV Cam AE3), fournit des traductions "
"complètes de l'interface utilisateur dans l'ensemble complet des langues "
"intégrées, et enrichit le model zoo intégré avec une vaste collection "
"DeGirum et une nouvelle section consacrée au fournisseur Qualcomm AI Hub. "
"Cette version reste sur la base Qt Creator 14.0.2. Quelques éléments de menu"
" et options de ligne de commande pour développeurs ont été supprimés ; voir "
":ref:`Changements incompatibles <changelog_ide_v4_4_5>`."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Sur cette page"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Points forts"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Alif Ensemble (OpenMV Cam AE3) support** lets you load and recover "
"firmware on the new AE3 boards directly from the IDE, including a guided "
"recovery flow for bricked boards."
msgstr ""
"**La prise en charge d'Alif Ensemble (OpenMV Cam AE3)** vous permet de "
"charger et de récupérer le micrologiciel sur les nouvelles cartes AE3 "
"directement depuis l'IDE, y compris un flux de récupération guidé pour les "
"cartes inutilisables."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Localized UI translations** are now complete across the full bundled "
"language set, including OpenMV-specific dialog strings."
msgstr ""
"**Les traductions de l'interface utilisateur** sont désormais complètes dans"
" l'ensemble complet des langues intégrées, y compris les chaînes de dialogue"
" spécifiques à OpenMV."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:27
msgid ""
"**DeGirum model zoo** adds a large collection of YOLOv5n/YOLOv5nu/YOLOv8n "
"variants plus a new Model Zoo landing page."
msgstr ""
"**Le model zoo DeGirum** ajoute une vaste collection de variantes "
"YOLOv5n/YOLOv5nu/YOLOv8n ainsi qu'une nouvelle page d'accueil Model Zoo."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Qualcomm AI Hub models** add a new Qualcomm vendor section with 16 "
"quantized models across 15 model families (YOLOv8-Detection, Yolo-NAS, "
"Yolo-v7, DeepLabV3+ MobileNet, MediaPipe Face, MiDaS, MobileNet v2/v3, "
"PoseNet, ShuffleNet v2, SqueezeNet, GoogLeNet, and more), plus new Qualcomm "
"and Google vendor landing pages."
msgstr ""
"**Les modèles Qualcomm AI Hub** ajoutent une nouvelle section consacrée au "
"fournisseur Qualcomm avec 16 modèles quantifiés répartis sur 15 familles de "
"modèles (YOLOv8-Detection, Yolo-NAS, Yolo-v7, DeepLabV3+ MobileNet, "
"MediaPipe Face, MiDaS, MobileNet v2/v3, PoseNet, ShuffleNet v2, SqueezeNet, "
"GoogLeNet, et plus encore), ainsi que de nouvelles pages d'accueil pour les "
"fournisseurs Qualcomm et Google."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Camera USB drive matching** now selects the exact removable drive for the "
"connected camera by serial number on Windows, Linux, and macOS."
msgstr ""
"**La correspondance des lecteurs USB de la caméra** sélectionne désormais le"
" lecteur amovible exact correspondant à la caméra connectée par numéro de "
"série sous Windows, Linux et macOS."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:36
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when the helloworld script was rewritten for the connected "
"sensor."
msgstr ""
"Correction d'un plantage lorsque le script helloworld était réécrit pour le "
"capteur connecté."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:40
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nouvelles fonctionnalités"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:42
msgid ""
"Added the ability to load and recover firmware on the new Alif Ensemble "
"(**OpenMV Cam AE3**) boards directly from the IDE, using bundled Alif "
"command-line tools and a dedicated UART/DFU recovery bootloader. The flow "
"uses an internal, hidden ``OpenMV Cam AE3 SBL`` board entry (VID:PID "
"``37C5:16E3``) that is not exposed as a selectable board in the connection "
"dropdown (`e896a475b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e896a475b>`__, `c386a2680 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c386a2680>`__, `b2834df07 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b2834df07>`__, `2df2a5535 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2df2a5535>`__, `3079df0e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3079df0e4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Ajout de la possibilité de charger et de récupérer le micrologiciel sur les "
"nouvelles cartes Alif Ensemble (**OpenMV Cam AE3**) directement depuis "
"l'IDE, à l'aide des outils en ligne de commande Alif intégrés et d'un "
"programme d'amorçage de récupération UART/DFU dédié. Le flux utilise une "
"entrée de carte interne et cachée ``OpenMV Cam AE3 SBL`` (VID:PID "
"``37C5:16E3``) qui n'est pas proposée comme carte sélectionnable dans la "
"liste déroulante de connexion (`e896a475b <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e896a475b>`__, `c386a2680 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c386a2680>`__, `b2834df07 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b2834df07>`__, `2df2a5535 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2df2a5535>`__, `3079df0e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3079df0e4>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:53
msgid ""
"Corrupted or bricked Alif boards can now be reset and re-flashed via a "
"guided recovery flow that prompts you to enable the hard maintenance mode "
"switch (if not already on) and press the board's user button during the "
"maintenance-mode handshake (`ec69240ab <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ec69240ab>`__, `2fb7f9fde <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2fb7f9fde>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Les cartes Alif corrompues ou inutilisables peuvent désormais être "
"réinitialisées et reflashées via un flux de récupération guidé qui vous "
"invite à activer le commutateur matériel du mode de maintenance (s'il n'est "
"pas déjà activé) et à appuyer sur le bouton utilisateur de la carte pendant "
"la poignée de main du mode maintenance (`ec69240ab "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ec69240ab>`__, `2fb7f9fde "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2fb7f9fde>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:59
msgid ""
"OpenMV IDE now ships complete localized UI translations across its full "
"bundled language set, including OpenMV-specific dialog strings, generated "
"via a new auto-translation pipeline (`60228d5cb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/60228d5cb>`__, `b2e8cece4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/b2e8cece4>`__, `5d5fc17e9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5d5fc17e9>`__, `5d2ad4e64 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5d2ad4e64>`__, `43453aadd "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/43453aadd>`__)."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV IDE fournit désormais des traductions complètes de l'interface "
"utilisateur dans l'ensemble complet des langues intégrées, y compris les "
"chaînes de dialogue spécifiques à OpenMV, générées via un nouveau pipeline "
"de traduction automatique (`60228d5cb <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/60228d5cb>`__, `b2e8cece4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/b2e8cece4>`__, `5d5fc17e9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5d5fc17e9>`__, `5d2ad4e64 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5d2ad4e64>`__, `43453aadd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/43453aadd>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:67
msgid ""
"Added a large **DeGirum** model-zoo collection (YOLOv5n/YOLOv5nu/YOLOv8n "
"variants for car, coco, face, hand, license-plate, person, age, gender, "
"fruit, ppe, head, and pose/keypoint detection) plus a new Model Zoo landing "
"page (`e39989251 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/e39989251>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Ajout d'une vaste collection de model zoo **DeGirum** (variantes "
"YOLOv5n/YOLOv5nu/YOLOv8n pour la détection de voiture, coco, visage, main, "
"plaque d'immatriculation, personne, âge, sexe, fruit, EPI, tête, et "
"pose/point clé) ainsi qu'une nouvelle page d'accueil Model Zoo (`e39989251 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e39989251>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:71
msgid ""
"Added a new **Qualcomm AI Hub** vendor section with 16 quantized models "
"across 15 model families (``YOLOv8-Detection``, ``Yolo-NAS``, ``Yolo-v7``, "
"``deeplabv3_plus_mobilenet``, ``foot_track_net``, ``gear_guard_net``, "
"``googlenet``, ``mediapipe_face`` detector and landmark detector, ``midas``,"
" ``mobilenet_v2``, ``mobilenet_v3_large``, ``posenet_mobilenet``, "
"``shufflenet_v2``, and ``squeezenet1_1``), added new Qualcomm and Google "
"vendor landing pages, and reorganized Google MobileNet v1 models out of a "
"``classification`` subfolder (`2fbb806bd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2fbb806bd>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Ajout d'une nouvelle section consacrée au fournisseur **Qualcomm AI Hub** "
"avec 16 modèles quantifiés répartis sur 15 familles de modèles "
"(``YOLOv8-Detection``, ``Yolo-NAS``, ``Yolo-v7``, "
"``deeplabv3_plus_mobilenet``, ``foot_track_net``, ``gear_guard_net``, "
"``googlenet``, le détecteur ``mediapipe_face`` et le détecteur de points de "
"repère, ``midas``, ``mobilenet_v2``, ``mobilenet_v3_large``, "
"``posenet_mobilenet``, ``shufflenet_v2``, et ``squeezenet1_1``), ajout de "
"nouvelles pages d'accueil pour les fournisseurs Qualcomm et Google, et "
"réorganisation des modèles Google MobileNet v1 hors d'un sous-dossier "
"``classification`` (`2fbb806bd <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/2fbb806bd>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:82
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Autres changements et améliorations"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:84
msgid ""
"When copying scripts to a camera's USB drive, the IDE now selects the exact "
"removable drive belonging to the connected camera by matching its serial "
"number, instead of guessing among all mounted FAT volumes, on Windows, "
"Linux, and macOS (`ef28da191 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ef28da191>`__, `db98bc4b0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/db98bc4b0>`__, `9ee631e6f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9ee631e6f>`__, `d6b2a0976 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d6b2a0976>`__, `3b3c4c9a2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b3c4c9a2>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Lors de la copie de scripts vers le lecteur USB d'une caméra, l'IDE "
"sélectionne désormais le lecteur amovible exact appartenant à la caméra "
"connectée en faisant correspondre son numéro de série, au lieu de deviner "
"parmi tous les volumes FAT montés, sous Windows, Linux et macOS (`ef28da191 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ef28da191>`__, `db98bc4b0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/db98bc4b0>`__, `9ee631e6f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/9ee631e6f>`__, `d6b2a0976 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d6b2a0976>`__, `3b3c4c9a2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3b3c4c9a2>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:93
msgid ""
"Drive/USB serial-number lookups and serial-port scanning were moved onto the"
" existing drive-scan worker thread so the IDE UI stays responsive during "
"connection (`bcc78d48e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/bcc78d48e>`__, `3b3c4c9a2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b3c4c9a2>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Les recherches de numéro de série des lecteurs/USB et le balayage des ports "
"série ont été déplacés vers le thread de travail existant de balayage des "
"lecteurs afin que l'interface de l'IDE reste réactive pendant la connexion "
"(`bcc78d48e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/bcc78d48e>`__, "
"`3b3c4c9a2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3b3c4c9a2>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:98
msgid ""
"Added initial (currently disabled) plumbing for a variable ``get_state`` "
"payload size that would distinguish high-speed (511 bytes) from full-speed "
"(63 bytes) USB. The code is present but gated off via an ``if (0)`` branch, "
"so ``get_state`` still uses the original fixed 64-byte payload and there is "
"no user-visible behavior change in this release (`31c2e2990 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/31c2e2990>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Ajout d'une infrastructure initiale (actuellement désactivée) pour une "
"taille de charge utile ``get_state`` variable qui distinguerait l'USB haute "
"vitesse (511 octets) de la pleine vitesse (63 octets). Le code est présent "
"mais désactivé via une branche ``if (0)``, de sorte que ``get_state`` "
"utilise toujours la charge utile fixe d'origine de 64 octets et qu'il n'y a "
"aucun changement de comportement visible par l'utilisateur dans cette "
"version (`31c2e2990 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/31c2e2990>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:104
msgid ""
"Corrected the flash-erase address for the Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect "
"(legacy) bootloader from ``0x10800000`` to ``0x10200000`` (`132047c14 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/132047c14>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction de l'adresse d'effacement de la mémoire flash pour le programme "
"d'amorçage de l'Arduino Nano RP2040 Connect (ancien) de ``0x10800000`` à "
"``0x10200000`` (`132047c14 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/132047c14>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:107
msgid ""
"Removed the **CNN Network Library** tool that copied a model file to the "
"OpenMV Cam from the ``Machine Vision Tools`` menu (`07f83ce69 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/07f83ce69>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Suppression de l'outil **CNN Network Library** qui copiait un fichier de "
"modèle vers l'OpenMV Cam depuis le menu ``Machine Vision Tools`` (`07f83ce69"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/07f83ce69>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:110
msgid ""
"Hid the camera ``Configure Settings`` dialog menu action (`064fb3d83 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/064fb3d83>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Masquage de l'action de menu de la boîte de dialogue ``Configure Settings`` "
"de la caméra (`064fb3d83 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/064fb3d83>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:112
msgid ""
"Removed several developer/debug command-line options (``-settingspath``, "
"``-installsettingspath``, ``-pluginpath``, and "
"``-temporarycleansettings``/``-tcs``) from the application, leaving only "
"``-language`` for end users (`86d009d65 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/86d009d65>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Suppression de plusieurs options de ligne de commande pour "
"développeurs/débogage (``-settingspath``, ``-installsettingspath``, "
"``-pluginpath``, et ``-temporarycleansettings``/``-tcs``) de l'application, "
"ne laissant que ``-language`` pour les utilisateurs finaux (`86d009d65 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/86d009d65>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:119
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Corrections de bogues"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:121
msgid ""
"Fixed an IDE crash that occurred when the helloworld script was rewritten "
"for the connected sensor; the file is now reloaded from disk instead of "
"calling ``setPlainText`` (`5793b3120 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5793b3120>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction d'un plantage de l'IDE qui se produisait lorsque le script "
"helloworld était réécrit pour le capteur connecté ; le fichier est désormais"
" rechargé depuis le disque au lieu d'appeler ``setPlainText`` (`5793b3120 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5793b3120>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:125
msgid ""
"Fixed Python paste indentation so pasted code is no longer over-indented "
"past the indentation level of the preceding line (`8622327d9 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8622327d9>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction de l'indentation du collage Python afin que le code collé ne soit"
" plus sur-indenté au-delà du niveau d'indentation de la ligne précédente "
"(`8622327d9 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8622327d9>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:128
msgid ""
"Fixed the output (serial terminal) pane so it is restored to its "
"visible/hidden state on startup, and stopped a context-menu popup on its "
"toggle buttons (`a972ecdf5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a972ecdf5>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction du volet de sortie (terminal série) afin qu'il soit restauré dans"
" son état visible/masqué au démarrage, et suppression d'un menu contextuel "
"surgissant sur ses boutons de basculement (`a972ecdf5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a972ecdf5>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:132
msgid ""
"Fixed Alif device serial-port detection on macOS by only considering "
"``/dev/cu*`` ports and prefixing non-Windows port names with ``/dev/`` "
"(`277fe0c05 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/277fe0c05>`__, "
"`3079df0e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3079df0e4>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Correction de la détection des ports série des appareils Alif sous macOS en "
"ne considérant que les ports ``/dev/cu*`` et en préfixant les noms de ports "
"non-Windows par ``/dev/`` (`277fe0c05 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/277fe0c05>`__, `3079df0e4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3079df0e4>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:138
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Prise en charge des plateformes et des outils"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:140
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2."
msgstr "**Base Qt Creator :** 14.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:141
msgid ""
"The **GENX320** event camera is now recognized for the ``01-Camera/03-Event-"
"Cameras`` example set, so GENX320 boards see those examples (`7fd3c141c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/7fd3c141c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"La caméra événementielle **GENX320** est désormais reconnue pour l'ensemble "
"d'exemples ``01-Camera/03-Event-Cameras``, afin que les cartes GENX320 "
"voient ces exemples (`7fd3c141c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/7fd3c141c>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:145
msgid ""
"Added bundled Alif flashing tools (``share/qtcreator/alif`` version 1.100.0 "
"for linux-x86_64, mac, and windows) and a new ``OPENMV_AE3`` recovery "
"firmware/bootloader package, used internally by the AE3 firmware load and "
"recovery flow."
msgstr ""
"Ajout des outils de flashage Alif intégrés (``share/qtcreator/alif`` version"
" 1.100.0 pour linux-x86_64, mac et windows) et d'un nouveau paquet de "
"micrologiciel/programme d'amorçage de récupération ``OPENMV_AE3``, utilisés "
"en interne par le flux de chargement et de récupération du micrologiciel "
"AE3."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:149
msgid "OpenMV IDE version bumped from 4.4.4 to 4.4.5."
msgstr "Version d'OpenMV IDE passée de 4.4.4 à 4.4.5."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:152
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Changements incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:154
msgid "User-visible workflow changes between v4.4.4 and v4.4.5:"
msgstr ""
"Changements de flux de travail visibles par l'utilisateur entre la v4.4.4 et"
" la v4.4.5 :"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:156
msgid ""
"The **CNN Network Library** entry under the ``Machine Vision Tools`` menu "
"(which let you copy a ``.tflite``/``.network``/``.txt`` model file directly "
"to the OpenMV Cam) was removed, and the camera ``Configure Settings`` dialog"
" action is now hidden. Users relying on those menu items will no longer find"
" them."
msgstr ""
"L'entrée **CNN Network Library** du menu ``Machine Vision Tools`` (qui "
"permettait de copier un fichier de modèle ``.tflite``/``.network``/``.txt`` "
"directement vers l'OpenMV Cam) a été supprimée, et l'action de la boîte de "
"dialogue ``Configure Settings`` de la caméra est désormais masquée. Les "
"utilisateurs qui dépendaient de ces éléments de menu ne les trouveront plus."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.5.rst:161
msgid ""
"The command-line options ``-settingspath``, ``-installsettingspath``, "
"``-pluginpath``, and ``-temporarycleansettings``/``-tcs`` are no longer "
"accepted by the application (only ``-language`` remains). Scripts or "
"shortcuts relying on these flags will no longer take effect."
msgstr ""
"Les options de ligne de commande ``-settingspath``, "
"``-installsettingspath``, ``-pluginpath``, et "
"``-temporarycleansettings``/``-tcs`` ne sont plus acceptées par "
"l'application (seule ``-language`` subsiste). Les scripts ou raccourcis qui "
"dépendaient de ces indicateurs n'auront plus d'effet."
